---
source: core/src/orchestrator.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "Update your persistent heartbeat scratchpad/memo. This memo persists across heartbeat cycles within a day. Use it to track what you've done, what to check next, and observations. Write the COMPLETE memo content (not a diff). At quiet hours, this memo is archived and reset."
name: update_heartbeat_memo
parameters:
  properties:
    content:
      description: The complete memo content. Replaces the previous memo entirely.
      type: string
  required:
    - content
  type: object
